The printed name of r_88 is "-= Roomy Vault =-".
The roomy vault part 0 is some text that varies. The roomy vault part 0 is "You've entered a roomy vault.



There is an unguarded exit to the north.".
The description of r_88 is "[roomy vault part 0]".

The r_38 is mapped north of r_88.
