The printed name of r_93 is "-= Unreasonably Hot Canteen =-".
The unreasonably hot canteen part 0 is some text that varies. The unreasonably hot canteen part 0 is "I am sorry to announce that you are now in the unreasonably hot canteen.



You don't like doors? Why not try going north, that entranceway is unblocked.".
